# Toolchain pins for tools that are not npm-resolvable (asdf-compatible
# format). node-resolved linters are pinned by package-lock.json instead;
# both are read by the parity gate, so a version drift at ANY boundary fails
# the run by name rather than showing up as mysteriously different findings.
#
# shellcheck: findings differ across releases (0.9.0 reports SC2015 where
# 0.11.0 does not), so an unpinned CI silently disagrees with a green local
# run. CI installs exactly this version from the official upstream release.
shellcheck 0.11.0
